\newmarginnote{note.15.2}{{15}{29773047sp}}
\newlabel{fig:asos_d1_dist}{{8}{15}{ASOS: distribution of follow-up lengths across 144 treatment arms.\reviewtag {A1} The wide range of $\Dfollow $ (7--239 days) makes ASOS a challenging testbed: the model must extrapolate from 7~pilot days to horizons up to 34$\times $ longer.\relax }{figure.caption.29}{}}
