\newlabel{fig:asos_boxplot_abs}{{12}{24}{ASOS: accuracy distribution by method (144 arms).\reviewtag {A2} NB-SSP regression has the highest median (0.50) and the tightest spread. TG-SSP and IBP have lower medians and heavier left tails (many arms with $v \approx 0$).\relax }{figure.caption.55}{}}
